      "writtenOn": "2026-06-09T11:48:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Also just noticed that you are using a BUG_ON instead of returning an error. Whereas this condition may be caused by a malicious host, not by a pKVM bug? \n\nI think we will never reach here through invocation by a malicious host action. We have a check above to make sure that the page state is host owned and we fail early if thats not the case. And since host do not initiate donation from pkvm or guest back to host, I thought this should be a pkvm BUG. Which scenario do you feel that we could reach here as part of malicious host triggering?",
